cios-shell (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=low

  * Initial release.
  * Minimal Wayland compositor with wlroots 0.18+ backend.
  * XWayland support for legacy X11 applications.
  * JSON IPC protocol for runtime communication.
  * Layer-shell support for topbar exclusive zone.
  * Session desktop file for LightDM/GDM.

 -- CIOS Team <cios@localhost>  Mon, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000
